%% ID: S08 | Title: Consult Step 2 章節 inline edit + Accept/Refine/Skip/Flag | Last updated 2026-05-25
%% User action 1：BU 在某章 inline edit
%% User action 2：BU 點 Accept / Refine / Skip / Flag 任一按鈕
%% 對應 backend：edit_section / section_action（session_service.py:305 / 345）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor BU
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(SectionEditor / ActionButtons)
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant SVC as session_service.py
    participant G as Graph
    participant Bus as SSE Bus

    Note over BU,FE: 前置：BU 在 Consult Step 2，agent 已對某章<br/>提問或 BU 已看到 draft

    alt User action 1：Inline Edit
        BU->>FE: 在某章編輯 markdown 後 debounce 800ms
        FE->>API: PATCH /sessions/{id}/sections/{sid}<br/>{content}
        API->>SVC: edit_sectiondb, session, sid, content<br/>session_service.py:305
        SVC->>G: aget_state → outline
        SVC->>G: aupdate_state<br/>{brd_outline: outline 內 sid 章<br/>更新 draft_content + last_edit_by='bu'}
        SVC->>Bus: publish section_updated<br/>{section_id, section}
        Bus-->>FE: SSE section_updated<br/>更新該章 state
        SVC-->>API: SectionState dict
        API-->>FE: 200 SectionState
        FE->>FE: qc.invalidateQueries（refetch session）

    else User action 2：Accept / Refine / Skip / Flag
        BU->>FE: 點按鈕（其中之一）
        FE->>API: POST /sessions/{id}/sections/{sid}/action<br/>{action, payload?}
        API->>SVC: section_actiondb, session, sid, action<br/>session_service.py:345
        SVC->>G: aget_state → outline
        SVC->>SVC: status_map["action"]<br/>accept→accepted /<br/>skip→skipped /<br/>flag→flagged_for_ba /<br/>refine→needs_round2

        alt action 不在 {accept, refine, skip, flag}
            SVC-->>API: ValueError
            API-->>FE: 400
        end

        SVC->>SVC: 找下一個 needs_round2 章節（next_idx）<br/>沒有則 next_idx=None
        SVC->>G: aupdate_state<br/>{brd_outline: 更新後,<br/> current_section_idx: next_idx}
        SVC->>Bus: publish section_updated<br/>{section_id, section}
        Bus-->>FE: SSE section_updated → 更新該章

        alt next_idx 非 None
            SVC->>Bus: publish current_section_changed<br/>{section_id: 下一章}
            Bus-->>FE: SSE current_section_changed<br/>SectionInlineHeader 立刻跳下一章
        end

        SVC->>G: ainvoke{} 推進 graph
        Note over G: Consult subgraph entry：<br/>有 needs_round2 → section_loop 對下一章提問<br/>都已處理 → quality_gate 跑跨章衝突檢查
        G->>Bus: publish agent_reply_delta×N + done<br/>(section_loop) 或 conflict_detected (quality_gate)
        Bus-->>FE: SSE → 對話區渲染下一題或顯示衝突提示
        SVC-->>API: SectionState dict
        API-->>FE: 200 SectionState
    end
